,{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/dialogIcon(_:)":{"title":"dialogIcon(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/dialogicon(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/dialogIcon(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogIcon","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI5ImageV","text":"Image","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}}}